  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 227.88pt, "Abstract: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#222222"))
  #line-at(125.52pt, 227.88pt, "Stimuli-responsive materials offer a promising route to dynamically tailor material ")
  #line-at(72pt, 255.48pt, "behavior, enabling adaptive functionalities in changing environments. However, simultaneously ")
  #line-at(72pt, 283.08pt, "implementing spatial and temporal control in active material systems remains a fundamental ")
  #line-at(72pt, 310.68pt, "challenge. Here, we present a photothermally programmable shape memory polymer (SMP) ")
  #line-at(72pt, 338.28pt, "metamaterial platform that enables dynamic control of elastic wave propagation through ")
  #line-at(72pt, 365.88pt, "reconfigurable spatiotemporal temperature distributions. By projecting user-defined light patterns ")
  #line-at(72pt, 393.48pt, "onto carbon-doped SMP (C-SMP) surfaces, spatial thermomechanical property landscapes are ")
  #line-at(72pt, 421.08pt, "generated, enabling a wide range of elastic wave functionalities, including tunable transmission ")
  #line-at(72pt, 448.68pt, "spectra and programmable vibrational modes. By treating both space and time as design ")
  #line-at(72pt, 476.28pt, "parameters, we access an expanded design space that allows a bulk C-SMP surface to function as ")
  #line-at(72pt, 503.88pt, "a highly adaptive metamaterial platform. This work establishes spatiotemporal property ")
  #line-at(72pt, 531.48pt, "modulation as a powerful framework for adaptive vibration control, tunable phononic systems")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(537pt, 531.48pt, ", ")
  #line-at(72pt, 559.08pt, "and other advanced dynamic applications.")
]

